# Project02-local .gitignore.
#
# Scope discipline: this file only covers paths inside projects/project02/.
# Patterns affecting other monorepo projects belong in the monorepo-root
# .gitignore. See projects/project02/scratch/phase1-strays-inventory.md for
# the rationale behind keeping Project02 changes self-contained.
#
# ============================================================
# AWS / RDS credentials — NEVER commit
# ============================================================
# Real photoapp-config.ini holds [rds] endpoint + user_pwd and the
# [s3readwrite]/[s3readonly] aws_access_key_id pairs. The .example
# template (committed) is provisioned per operator into the real file
# below, which must stay out of git.
client/photoapp-config.ini

# Defense in depth: any other credential-shaped file inside project02.
**/*-credentials.ini
**/aws-credentials*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ============================================================
# Local Python / venv artifacts (Project02 client uses Python)
# ============================================================
# These are also covered indirectly by other ignores, but spelling out
# inside Project02 makes intent obvious to readers of this directory.
client/.venv/
client/.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# ============================================================
# Generated EB bundles
# ============================================================
build/eb/

# Terraform working directories (lock files remain tracked intentionally).
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfplan

# ============================================================
# Phase 1.5 archived artifacts (submission artifacts/)
# ============================================================
# When deprecated content was moved out of dist/ and images/ into
# submission artifacts/ during Phase 1.5, those items left the scope of
# the monorepo-root .gitignore (which only matched the original paths).
# Re-cover them here so we don't accidentally commit ~15 MB of submission
# tarballs or the vendored instructor repo's own .git directory.
#
# Tracked archive items (the two packaging scripts) are NOT matched by
# these patterns and remain visible to git.
submission artifacts/dist/
submission artifacts/images/
